      "In $(-\\infty, -2)$, $f'(x) > 0 \\Rightarrow$ Strictly Increasing.",
      "In $(-2, 3)$, $f'(x) < 0 \\Rightarrow$ Strictly Decreasing.",
      "In $(3, \\infty)$, $f'(x) > 0 \\Rightarrow$ Strictly Increasing."
    ],
    "finalAnswer": "Inc: (-∞, -2) ∪ (3, ∞), Dec: (-2, 3)",
